# Comparison of regularization strategies

All strategies were applied in **whitened space** (spectral-diagonal prewhitening (validated)).

Whitening validation: whitened tail variance 1.027 (target 1.0), whitened beta tail ACF(1..5) = [-0.131 -0.035 -0.052  0.099 -0.118], whitened-residual Ljung-Box Q(10) = 9.73, p = 0.4643. Raw-data misfit is reported for completeness but is misleading under colored noise: the raw residual autocorrelates (ACF(1) ~ 0.36 for a k=150 truncation) even when the whitened residual is white.

